If “Yes", please provide in column L: (1) emission in ton CO2e; (2) standards adopted for accounting; (3) emission per unit of production value.
GHG emission per unit of production value can be calculated as: C=A/B, where:
C--GHG emission per unit of production value, in tonCO2e/10000CNY;
A--Calculated scope 2 GHG emissions, in ton CO2e;
B--Production value of the corporate last year, in 10000 CNY

If “Yes", please provide in column L: (1) emission in ton CO2e; (2) standards adopted for accounting; (3) emission per unit of production value.
GHG emission per unit of production value can be calculated as: C=A/B, where:
C--GHG emission per unit of production value, in tonCO2e/10000CNY;
A--Calculated scope 2 GHG emissions, in ton CO2e;
B--Production value of the corporate last year, in 10000 CNY

If “Yes", please describe in column L: the value of parameters in the formula of wastewater reuse rate. Please reply as "In 2021, Vw is xx cubic meters, Vd is xx cubic meters, and Lw is xx%"
The wastewater reuse rate is calculated as: Lw=Vw/(Vd+Vw )×100%, where:
Lw——Waste water reuse rate;
Vw——The amount of wastewater that is reused after treatment during the statistical period, in cubic meters;
